OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CSunday:FA very wet day for many as     
OL,6,Fpersistent rain continues, mainly      
OL,7,Ffocused around Devon. Feeling cold,    
OL,8,Fespecially with the brisk breeze       
OL,9,Finland and the very strong coastal     
OL,10,Fwinds.                                 
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fin the southwest on Monday with        
OL,14,Fshowery spells later. On Tuesday,      
OL,15,Fwindy with spells of rain. Calmer on   
OL,16,FWednesday but with further intervals   
OL,17,Fof rain and cloud.                     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
